  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "这位厉害的训练家，\n我得到了很好的大葱哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D53895BB376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A62115F9752304E865F88597D76845927847154E6FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你知道大葱鸭\n这种宝可梦吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 480,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6077E59053592784719E2D000A8FD979CD5B9D53EF68A65417FF1F00100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它总是拿着植物的茎，\n有时还会把茎当作武器挥舞。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83603B662F62FF7740690D72697684830EFF0C000A670965F68FD84F1A628A830E5F534F5C6B6656686325821E300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "也有一些关于大葱鸭和大葱的\n危险传闻……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E5F67094E004E9B51734E8E592784719E2D548C592784717684000A537196694F2095FB2026202600100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "据说在夜晚……让1只大葱鸭携带大葱，\n再带它去某个地方，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就会有不肖之徒来偷袭你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "636E8BF45728591C665A202620268BA9003153EA592784719E2D643A5E2659278471FF0C000A518D5E265B8353BB67D04E2A573065B9FF0C00100001BE00000A5C314F1A67094E0D80964E4B5F926765507788AD4F60300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这位厉害的训练家，\n请你去反击那个不肖之徒。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n大葱我会送你的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 732,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD94F4D53895BB376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C000A8BF74F6053BB53CD51FB90A34E2A4E0D80964E4B5F92300200100001BE00000A5927847162114F1A90014F607684300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要去反击不肖之徒，\n需要在<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>夜晚<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>只带上<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>1只<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>携带了<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大葱<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大葱鸭<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n前往<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>榴红7号街区<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的巷子里。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 34,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n想起了委托人说的话……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n要去反击不肖之徒，\n需要在<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>夜晚<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>只带上<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>1只<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>携带了<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大葱<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>大葱鸭<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000><U+0010><U+0001>븀\n前往<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0006>榴红7号街区<U+0010><U+0002>＀<U+0000>的巷子里。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 37,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 107
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那个大葱……是一把好武器。\n我想让大葱鸭们互相交手！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A34E2A5927847120262026662F4E00628A597D6B6656683002000A621160F38BA9592784719E2D4EEC4E9276F84EA4624BFF0100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "什么什么？那个巨大的葱怎么回事！？\n这不是伽勒尔的样子的大葱鸭吗！？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4EC04E484EC04E48FF1F90A34E2A5DE8592776848471600E4E4856DE4E8BFF01FF1F000A8FD94E0D662F4F3D52D25C14768468375B507684592784719E2D5417FF01FF1F00100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱鸭！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54719E2DFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕鸭！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54959E2DFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刀葱无情！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5200847165E060C5FF0100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "对了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5BF94E86300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是我小看你了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F62115C0F770B4F604E86FF0100100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "面对突然的偷袭也镇定自若的茎术……\n想必你是一位享有盛名的训练家。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "97625BF97A8171367684507788AD4E5F95475B9A81EA82E57684830E672F20262026000A60F35FC54F60662F4E004F4D4EAB670976DB540D76848BAD7EC35BB6300200100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能打败他，\n看来你很有本领啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD62538D254ED6FF0C000A770B67654F605F886709672C9886554A300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯。那么在下也想\n与你来一场全力以赴的对战。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EF300290A34E4857284E0B4E5F60F3000A4E0E4F6067654E00573A5168529B4EE58D7476845BF96218300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "同志的失败就是在下的失败。\n我要雪耻。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "540C5FD7768459318D255C31662F57284E0B768459318D253002000A6211898196EA803B300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等下等下……！\n居然是伽勒尔的大葱鸭！？<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n呃，即使如此我也只能上了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7B494E0B7B494E0B20262026FF01000A5C457136662F4F3D52D25C147684592784719E2DFF01FF1F00100001BE00000A5443FF0C53734F7F59826B6462114E5F53EA80FD4E0A4E86FF0100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱～鸭！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5471FF5E9E2DFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕鸭！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54959E2DFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刀葱无情！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5200847165E060C5FF0100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1812,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在下认输！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "57284E0B8BA48F93FF0100100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如此高强的实力……\n不知是经过多少修炼才能到这一步……？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59826B649AD85F3A76845B9E529B20262026000A4E0D77E5662F7ECF8FC7591A5C114FEE70BC624D80FD52308FD94E006B6520262026FF1F00100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没想到他们两个都被打败了……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA160F352304ED64EEC4E244E2A90FD88AB62538D254E862026202600100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样下去，\n会玷污我们大葱三人组的名声啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD968374E0B53BBFF0C000A4F1A73B76C6162114EEC592784714E094EBA7EC47684540D58F0554A300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是统领三人组的伍世……\n也就是说，我是三人当中最厉害的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 2004,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F7EDF98864E094EBA7EC476844F0D4E1620262026000A4E5F5C31662F8BF4FF0C6211662F4E094EBA5F534E2D670053895BB37684300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "让你见识一下关都流茎术吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 2072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BA94F6089C18BC64E004E0B517390FD6D41830E672F5427300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不管对手是伽勒尔的大葱鸭还是谁，\n见识一下我的关都流茎术吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D7BA15BF9624B662F4F3D52D25C147684592784719E2D8FD8662F8C01FF0C000A89C18BC64E004E0B62117684517390FD6D41830E672F5427300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "做好觉悟吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "505A597D89C9609F5427FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱鸭！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 2204,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54719E2DFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咕鸭！！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2212,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54959E2DFF01FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "刀葱无情！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5200847165E060C5FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿%",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2244,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00250000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "干得漂亮！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5E725F976F024EAEFF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱鸭！呱鸭、呱鸭啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54719E2DFF0154719E2D300154719E2D554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……呵呵呵。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "20262026547554755475300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀～\n真是一场漂亮的对战！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2324,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF5E000A771F662F4E00573A6F024EAE76845BF96218FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不好意思，其实我们是\n电影《三人的大葱》的影迷。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 2364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D597D610F601DFF0C51765B9E62114EEC662F000A75355F71300A4E094EBA768459278471300B76845F718FF7300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们的梦想是按照电影里的情景\n打一场宝可梦对战。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2424,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC768468A660F3662F6309716775355F7191CC768460C5666F000A62534E00573A5B9D53EF68A65BF96218300200100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但要实现这个梦想，就必须得找到\n有实力的大葱鸭与训练家和我们对战。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4689815B9E73B08FD94E2A68A660F3FF0C5C315FC5987B5F97627E5230000A67095B9E529B7684592784719E2D4E0E8BAD7EC35BB6548C62114EEC5BF96218300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "于是我们就发现了你，\n并设法引导你去巷子里！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E8E662F62114EEC5C3153D173B04E864F60FF0C000A5E768BBE6CD55F155BFC4F6053BB5DF75B5091CCFF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "为了营造紧迫感，\n所以没有事先告诉你详情。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E3A4E86842590207D278FEB611FFF0C000A62404EE56CA167094E8B5148544A8BC94F608BE660C5300200100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们的行为相当于骗了你，\n真的很抱歉……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC7684884C4E3A76F85F534E8E9A974E864F60FF0C000A771F76845F8862B16B492026202600100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但对于你的协助，\n我们打心眼里感激！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 2720,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F465BF94E8E4F607684534F52A9FF0C000A62114EEC62535FC3773C91CC611F6FC0FF0100100002011401D40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀！我梦寐以求的那句台词……\n终于说出口了呀。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǕ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 2768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440FF01621168A65BD04EE56C42768490A353E553F08BCD20262026000A7EC84E8E8BF451FA53E34E865440300200100002011401D50000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看来大葱鸭它们也很配合，\n刚才表现得很到位。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǓ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B6765592784719E2D5B834EEC4E5F5F88914D5408FF0C000A521A624D886873B05F975F8852304F4D300200100002011401D30000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呱鸭！呱鸭、呱鸭啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 2884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54719E2DFF0154719E2D300154719E2D554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那么，我等便告退了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǔ",
